      "source": [
        "### (i) Reflection: Why do skip connections help?\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "duxSFWqIXbjV"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Solution:** Skip connections provide a direct path for fine-grained spatial information from the encoder to reach the decoder, bypassing the compression bottleneck. This allows the model to reconstruct sharp edges and intricate details.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
